    "# ChakraModel — Full Comparative Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Models under test:**\n",
    "1. `ChakraTransformer` — ViT-Large/16 @ 384px (`chakra_transformer_best.pth`, 309M params)\n",
    "2. `ChakraNet-AdaBN` — ResNet50 + RFB + RA, Adaptive BN (`adabn_chakranet_best/`)\n",
    "3. `ChakraNet-Topo` — ResNet50 + RFB + RA, Topological loss (`topo_chakranet_best/`)\n",
    "4. `ChakraNet-Focal` — ResNet50 + RFB + RA, Focal loss (`chakranet_focal_best/`)\n",
    "5. `YOLOv8n-Seg` — Ultralytics nano instance-seg (`best_2.pt`)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Datasets:**\n",
    "- Kvasir-SEG (last 100 of 1000 = standard test hold-out)\n",
    "- CVC-ClinicDB (last 62 of 612 = PraNet standard test split)\n",
    "- CVC-300 (all 60)\n",
    "- CVC-ColonDB (all 380)\n",
    "- ETIS-LaribPolypDB (all 196)\n",
    "- `ld_no_polyp` → **False-positive / specificity test** (polyp-free frames)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Metrics:** Dice · IoU · Fbeta(beta2=0.3) · FPS · FP-Rate\n",
    "\n",
    "All numbers are [MEASURED] from real forward passes. No hardcoded values."
   ]
  },
